        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Dane, Garry Marshall\n- Products: Charmed, Grey's Anatomy, Marley & Me, Valentine's Day, Burlesque, Open Water 2: Adrift\n- Topics: television roles, films, promotional claims\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2000s, Eric Dane appeared in television roles including Charmed.\n- Eric Dane became known for playing Dr. Mark Sloan on the medical drama television series Grey's Anatomy.\n- Eric Dane co-starred in the film Marley & Me in 2008.\n- Valentine's Day is a 2010 American romantic comedy film directed by Garry Marshall.\n- Eric Dane co-starred in the films Valentine's Day and Burlesque in 2010.\n- Promotional posters for Open Water 2: Adrift claim that the film is based on actual events.",
